ssociation.org\/competitions\/CanadianChampionship2023). The top-three Canadian competitors will be recognized for the national podium.\r\n\r\nThis competition will have competitors simultaneously competing in 3x3x3 Fewest Moves at different locations across Canada with one winner.\r\n\r\nThis isn't your typical speed solving competition as 3x3x3 Fewest Moves is the only event. This is an **exam-style event** in which competitors spend up to an hour finding the shortest solution they can and **writing it down on paper**. If you are looking to compete in the traditional 3x3x3 speed solving event or other timed events, please look for [another competition in Canada](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions?region=Canada).\r\n### [FR]\r\nCette comp\u00e9tition est le **Championnat canadien de 3x3x3 r\u00e9solution optimis\u00e9e (ou FMC)** car nous n'organiserons pas cette \u00e9preuve lors du [Championnat canadien 2023] (https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/CanadianChampionship2023). Les trois premiers comp\u00e9titeurs canadiens seront reconnus pour le podium national.\r\n\r\nDans le cadre de cette comp\u00e9tition, des comp\u00e9titeurs participeront simultan\u00e9ment \u00e0 l'\u00e9preuve du 3x3x3 r\u00e9solution optimis\u00e9e \u00e0 diff\u00e9rents endroits au Canada et un seul gagnant sera d\u00e9sign\u00e9.\r\n\r\nIl ne s'agit pas d'une comp\u00e9tition typique o\u00f9 il faut r\u00e9soudre le plus vite possible, car la seule \u00e9preuve est le 3x3x3 r\u00e9solution optimis\u00e9e. Il s'agit d'une **\u00e9preuve de type examen** au cours de laquelle les comp\u00e9titeurs passent jusqu'\u00e0 une heure \u00e0 trouver la solution la plus courte possible et \u00e0 **l'\u00e9crire sur papier**. Si vous cherchez \u00e0 participer \u00e0 une comp\u00e9tition de speedcubing plus classique, merci de chercher [une autre comp\u00e9tition au Canada](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions?region=Canada).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Locations \/ Lieux\r\n### [EN]\r\nPlease see the [Locations tab](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/FMCCanada2023#24263-locations-lieux) for more details.\r\n### [FR]\r\nMerci de regarder [l'onglet lieux](https:\/\/www.worldcubeassociation.org\/competitions\/FMCCanada2023#24263-locations-lieux) pour plus de d\u00e9tails.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Notice of Filming and Photography \/ Avis de droit \u00e0 l'image\r\n### [EN]\r\nAttendees of Speedcubing Canada competitions consent to their images being used by Speedcubing Canada and its partners in marketing materials, social media and other digital platforms.\r\n### [FR]\r\nLes participants aux comp\u00e9titions de Speedcubing Canada consentent \u00e0 ce que leurs images soient utilis\u00e9es par Speedcubing Canada et ses partenaires dans de cadre de la promotion de ses activit\u00e9s notamment sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux et autres plateformes num\u00e9riques.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"FMCColombia2023","name":"FMC Colombia 2023","city":"Multiple locations","country":"CO","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333fm"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Andres Felipe Rodr\u00edguez Londo\u00f1o}{mailto:alondono@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Dennis Rosero}{mailto:drosero@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Jos\u00e9 Leonardo Chaparro Prieto}{mailto:jprieto@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Michael Andres Castillo Lemus}{mailto:rubikandres15@gmail.com}] [{Sergio Andres Guillen Ibarra}{mailto:sibarra@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Andres Felipe Rodr\u00edguez Londo\u00f1o}{mailto:alondono@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Dennis Rosero}{mailto:drosero@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Jos\u00e9 Leonardo Chaparro Prieto}{mailto:jprieto@worldcubeassociation.org}] [{Sergio Andres Guillen Ibarra}{mailto:sibarra@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"Multiple cities","address":"Multiple locations","details":"See the locations tab for more information about venue locations","c