ask or practice social distancing, we encourage you to sanitize regularly and be respectful of personal space. If you are comfortable wearing a mask, please do so!\r\n\r\n**Volunteering**\r\nWe will need your help as volunteers to support with the running and judging of the day. If you would like to volunteer to help staff at the competition, please contact [Maverick Pearson](mpearson@worldcubeassociation.org). Groups will be assigned so that volunteer duties don't clash with your competing.\r\n\r\n**Cube Shop**\r\nCape Town's own cube shop, [Speedcubes.co.za](https:\/\/www.speedcubes.co.za\/), will have a stall open at the competition to sell a variety of puzzles. Check out their website to see what's available! \r\n\r\n**Zero-waste Tuck Shop**\r\nThere will be a tuck shop open near the school hall with healthy and tasty snacks, coffee, and drinks. There will also be a lunch option that can be booked beforehand. We will share the link to this booking closer to the day via email.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"GrenobleWinter2014","name":"Grenoble Winter Open 2014","city":"Grenoble","country":"FR","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333fm","333oh","444","555","pyram","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Philippe Virouleau}{mailto:pvirouleau@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Laure Dousset}{mailto:laure.dousset@gmail.com}] [{Philippe Virouleau}{mailto:pvirouleau@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"Grenoble \u00c9cole de Management","address":"12 rue Pierre Semard","details":"From the main entrance, go to the first floor, then follow the signs.","coordinates":{"latitude":45.190536,"longitude":5.713255}},"information":"The competition will be free. Maybe there will be some prize depending on upcoming sponsorship.","externalWebsite":"http:\/\/gwo2014.speedcubingfrance.org\/"},{"id":"GreveGymnasium2020","name":"Greve Gymnasium 2020","city":"Greve","country":"DK","date":{"from":"2023-06-2